  <p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">The accompanying notes are an integral part of the consolidated financial statements.</span></p>
  <p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"><br/>Note A: </span><ix:footnote id="FNT_33f3c7cf-cdad-45fd-8736-d2a37344d27f" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">A total of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_16b16e55-6d75-4548-9b57-a7b8c448d8c1" contextRef="C_94db9b97-c113-414e-9ce4-7ac2413f8d3f" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromIssueOfOrdinaryShares" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">23,027,787</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> net proceeds was raised which comprised of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_ae52d5d6-40f0-4a58-861b-7d0ef6434fb8" contextRef="C_b7a96838-bc2e-4119-ac49-416da95663b2" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromIssueOfOrdinaryShares" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">19,994,760</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> from a private placement (Note 14a) and $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_de218134-5037-4be9-b409-7d070ac8be25" contextRef="C_a404f7fb-946c-44d0-b9bd-a8c8fb268735" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromIssueOfOrdinaryShares" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3,033,027</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> from an ATM offering (Note 14c) of which an amount of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_ddaec5a7-152f-4480-aab7-6d20a69d8601" contextRef="C_bbbad415-d16b-4d99-a0f5-25f3ea3eb703" name="asln:FinancialLiabilitiesMeasuredAtFairValueThroughProfitOrLoss" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3,465,180</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> was recorded as financial liabilities measured at fair value through profit or loss as at the inception date relating to Tranche 1B &amp; 2B warrants (Note 14a). Included within the private placement is Tranche 1A Warrant of $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_143b36c4-d0ce-47eb-923b-d19b49782305" contextRef="C_f82d6fff-608f-40b4-927b-679c18cae98a" name="asln:ReclassificationAdjustmentsFromEquityInstrumentsToAccumulatedDeficit" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1,539,897</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> which lapsed during the year and has been subsequently reclassified from equity instruments to accumulated deficit (Note 14a).</span></ix:footnote><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p>
