cimal">1,329,339</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">) and $</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_b60fecd6-1884-4529-bb7b-9c6a162c3696" contextRef="C_a895f41c-1617-4a62-9c28-a36c61806a1a" name="ifrs-full:CashFlowsFromUsedInOperatingActivities" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">137,735</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> respectively. The Company share in losses of associate amount to $</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_32ab0d86-dde4-42ae-8c4d-b798dcbbae68" contextRef="C_6d23ef7d-e321-43ed-a384-1638c9d27d7d" name="ifrs-full:ShareOfProfitLossOfAssociatesAccountedForUsingEquityMethod" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">486,141</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> and $</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_1229ceea-76fc-47fc-aabd-e3eb6424104b" contextRef="C_a895f41c-1617-4a62-9c28-a36c61806a1a" name="ifrs-full:ShareOfProfitLossOfAssociatesAccountedForUsingEquityMethod" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">8,587</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> for the years ended December 31, 2022 and December 31, 2023, and the balance of investment in associate company were $</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix: