pace:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;"> and $</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_a01db0b6-5fca-47d7-af4d-f7e8f0702cf2" contextRef="C_4c593710-794d-4d90-b81c-75337af2cc14" name="ifrs-full:TradeAndOtherPayablesToTradeSuppliers" unitRef="U_USD" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">7,918,607</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">, respectively and repayable on demand or within the normal credit terms.</span></p><ix:exclude><div style="flex-direction:column;display:flex;padding-bottom:0.5in;min-height:0.5in;justify-content:flex-end;box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">F-</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;min-width:fit-content;">23</span></p></div>
