        <td style="vertical-align:middle;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span><ix:nonNumeric id="F_f9005e5f-6a78-472a-aa52-6a237a5d0529" contextRef="C_055039ae-4be7-4149-8a50-bdf8d2790eb7" name="asln:DescriptionOfValuationTechniquesAndKeyInputs"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;min-width:fit-content;">Option Pricing Model (Binomial Tree Model).<br/>The following variable were taken into consideration: Time to maturity, current share price, strike price, risk free rate, dividend yield and volatility</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p></td>
